# Avengers: Endgame (2019)

**Avengers: Endgame** is a Marvel superhero movie directed by Anthony and Joe Russo. It follows the remaining Avengers as they try to bring back the people who disappeared after Thanos wiped out half of all life in the universe. The heroes reunite, travel through time, and face their greatest challenge in an attempt to save the universe. The movie features popular characters such as Iron Man, Captain America, Thor, Hulk, Black Widow, and Thanos. It is known for its exciting battles, emotional moments, friendship, teamwork, and sacrifices.
